  "releaseNotes": "Zoom presets below 1x now work on Android. An ultra-wide lens is a separate\n\t\t\tvideo input there, not a zoom factor, so a \"0.6x\" preset was silently dropped while iOS\n\t\t\toffered it (Safari fuses the rear lenses into one camera). The camera now enumerates the\n\t\t\tlenses and reopens the stream on the ultra-wide one when a sub-1x preset is picked. New:\n\t\t\tICameraCapture.GetLensesAsync/UseLensAsync/DescribeCamerasAsync, CameraLens/CameraLensKind,\n\t\t\tand the EnableLensSwitching and Style parameters. Using the component is unchanged; only a\n\t\t\tcustom ICameraCapture implementation needs the three new members.",
